<title>USA: FGIC qualifies two muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies two muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following two municipal issues:</p>
<p>--Averill Park Central School District, N.Y., $13 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Elmira Heights Central School District, N.Y., $4.61 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
